---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13025550147';
const phoneDisplay = '(302) 555-0147';
---
<Layout title="Ductless Mini-Split in Middletown, DE | AC Repair Middletown" description="Ductless mini-split repair and installation in Middletown, DE. Zone comfort for homes and additions.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Ductless Mini-Split</h1>
      <p>Zone Comfort · Middletown &amp; New Castle County</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Ductless systems are ideal for additions, older homes without ducts, and room-by-room temperature control. We repair and install major brands.</p>
      <h2>What We Provide</h2>
      <ul>
          <li>Single and multi-zone systems</li>
          <li>Repair of indoor and outdoor units</li>
          <li>Line set and condensate expertise</li>
          <li>Efficient heating and cooling in one unit</li>
          <li>Quiet operation and modern controls</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`} style="color:var(--primary);font-weight:600">{phoneDisplay}</a> for same-day service in Middletown, DE. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
